A bunch of programs that use wily for their user interface,
and tools to create such programs.

Current:
- python3   python3 interface for wily messages
- perl      Perl interfacde for wily messages
- tcl       Tcl/Tk interface for wily messages
- win       simple terminal
- quanstro  shell programming tools from erik quanstrom <quanstro@Infomkt.ibm.com>

